1	/* Tier-2 C-level round-trip smoke test.
2	 *
3	 * Phase 1 (QEMU1): printf via newlib stdio -> libgloss_vh -> semihosting,
4	 *   handled by QEMU. Then csrwi 0x7C0, 0 -- plugin drains state.
5	 * Phase 2 (vsim):  empty body. Phase-2 rule (rt_c_helpers.h): no syscall
6	 *   may issue inside this span.
7	 * Phase 3 (QEMU2): printf again, then crt0 calls _exit(0) -> libgloss_vh
8	 *   semihosting SYS_EXIT_EXTENDED.
9	 */
